      "title": "Pentagon says execution of Fort Hood shooter will be livestreamed",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/08/hegseth-fort-hood-shooter-public-execution",
      "description": "<p>Nidal Hasan, army psychiatrist who killed 13 people, will be executed by firing squad on 3 December</p><p>Pete Hegseth has said the execution of Nidal Hasan, the former army psychiatrist who killed 13 people at Fort Hood, will be a public event when the sentence is carried out later this year. A defense department official later confirmed the execution will be livestreamed.</p><p>In an interview with Real America’s Voice, the Pentagon secretary said the firing squad will carry out the sentence at Fort Hood, Texas, at 1pm on Thursday, 3 December. This would be the first US military execution in more than 60 years.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/08/hegseth-fort-hood-shooter-public-execution\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-10-08T23:18:29"
    },
